--TEST--
`tainted` and `secret` are independent axes, so a `secret tainted string` sets both bits on one token rather than the editor having to choose between them, `rule:security/secret-qualifier`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Handler {
    public function handle(secret tainted string $body): secret tainted string {
        return $body;
    }
}
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens
--EXPECT--
2:7+7 class
3:21+6 method
3:50+5 parameter tainted,secret
4:16+5 variable tainted,secret
